	"The **Analysis** index gathers notes that investigate how the system behaves:\na measurement, a profiling pass, a root-cause dig that isn't yet a fix. The\noutput is a conclusion you can act on, with the evidence attached. (A study held\nup *against an alternative* — what to adopt from another tool or paradigm, where\nwe differ — is a [Comparison](./comparison.html), not an Analysis.)\n\nThis note is an *index* (`moc: true`): a note is filed here by listing `analysis`\nin its `parents`. The graph renders it large; the notes wired to it are its\ncluster, and its card on the [Atlas](./index.html) lists them all.",
